    name: "Normal Attack: Radiant Wingslash",
    tag: "Low priority",
    desc: "Up to four sword strikes — 45.7% / 41% / 29.2%+29.2% / 71.2% at Lv.1; Charged 113.4% for 20 Stamina; Plunge 63.9% (128% low / 160% high). Durin's field time goes to Skill and Burst, so level this last.",
    priority: "Level last",
  },
  {
    name: "Skill: Binary Form, Convergence and Division",
