    desc: "After completing Witch's Homework: Of This World, Durin becomes a Hexerei character. With 2+ Hexerei members in the party, Hexerei: Secret Rite amplifies his Burst — stronger RES shred in White form, higher Vaporize/Melt bonuses in Dark form.",
